	(text "NOTE:\nRAW POWER AND BUCK GND\nWILL BE CONNECTED INTO A GND POUR.\nTHE GND POUR IS TO BE TREATED AS\nA NOISY ZONE.\nGND LOGIC IS CLEAN AND EXCLUSIVE\nFOR THE LOGIC BOARD.\nIT WILL BE CONNECTED TO LIPO GND\nTO ADDRESS TB6612FNG INTERNALLY\nCONNECTED GND PINS.\n\nTHERE WILL BE AN EXTERNAL TOGGLE\nPANEL MOUNT SWITCH BEFORE THE \nLIPO'S TERMINAL BLOCK."
